issuer is excluded by Rule 100(b)
=================================

6 ways this can be satisfied.

  1. (b)(1) — not organized under State or territorial law OF issuer
  2. (b)(2) — an Exchange Act reporting company OF issuer
  3. (b)(3) — an investment company OF issuer
  4. (b)(4) — subject to a bad-actor disqualification OF issuer
  5. (b)(5) — delinquent in ongoing annual reports OF issuer
  6. (b)(6) — no specific business plan, or a blank-check business plan OF issuer
